# With nothing unsaved, a change by another program reloads silently and keeps the focus.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
	- Buy milk
END
keys j j
see ▌   - Buy milk
outside <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
	- Buy bread
	- Buy milk
END
status Reloaded (changed on disk)
see     - Buy bread
see ▌   - Buy milk
